#. ja: 軍用エンジニアマニュアル
#. de: Ge<shy>sell<shy>schafts-Leitfaden[p] „Ingenieurswissen“
#. fr: manuel militaire d'ingénieur
#. column 2: company-issue engineering manuals
#. column 8: This comprehensive manual on crafting contains knowledge amassed over centuries by well-traveled Disciples of the Hand. It is known to inspire all who read it, granting a temporary 150% boost to experience points earned from synthesis (up to a maximum of 250,000 points). Effect is halved at level 40 and above.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 18 hours
#. column 9: Company-issue Engineering Manual
msgctxt "Item:4632:0:0"
msgid "company-issue engineering manual"
msgstr "армейское руководство по инженерному делу"

#. de: Ge<shy>sell<shy>schafts-Leitfäden[p] „Ingenieurswissen“
#. fr: manuels militaires d'ingénieur
#. column 0: company-issue engineering manual
#. column 8: This comprehensive manual on crafting contains knowledge amassed over centuries by well-traveled Disciples of the Hand. It is known to inspire all who read it, granting a temporary 150% boost to experience points earned from synthesis (up to a maximum of 250,000 points). Effect is halved at level 40 and above.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 18 hours
#. column 9: Company-issue Engineering Manual
msgctxt "Item:4632:0:2"
msgid "company-issue engineering manuals"
msgstr "армейские руководства по инженерному делу"

#. ja: 製作技術を解説した軍用の教練書。<br>製作時の経験値獲得量が上昇する<br>経験値獲得量 +150% [Lv40～効果半減]<br>ボーナス獲得上限 250,000<br>効果時間 18時間
#. de: Dieses umfassende Handbuch beinhaltet Wissen, das von Disziplinen der Handwerker über Jahrhunderte hinweg zu<shy>sammen<shy>getragen wurde. Es inspiriert den Leser und bewirkt dadurch einen temporären Bonus auf die Routine, die man durch das Synthetisieren von Gegenständen erhält, um 150<nbsp>% (75<nbsp>% ab Stufe 40, bis zu einem Maximum von 250.000).<br>Wirkungsdauer: 18 Stunden
#. fr: Un manuel militaire distribué aux unités chargées d'ingénierie, qui détaille avec beaucoup de précision les techniques de fabrication. Augmente le montant de points d'expérience obtenus lors de la synthèse.<br>Points d'expérience gagnés +150% jusqu'au niveau 39, puis +75%.<br>Bonus maximum<nbsp>: 250 000 points d'expérience.<br>Durée maximum d'effet<nbsp>: 18 heures.
#. column 0: company-issue engineering manual
#. column 2: company-issue engineering manuals
#. column 9: Company-issue Engineering Manual
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
