msgid "A Starlight Celebration dessert popular in Ul'dah. This cake, if it can be called that, is unparalleled in hardness and density. Every season, at least thirty-seven severe injuries are attributed to various fruitcake-related accidents.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3% <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>(Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)"
