#. ja: ロズリトオイスター
#. de: Rothlyt-Auster
#. fr: huître de Rothlyt
#. column 2: Rothlyt oysters
#. column 8: Also known as the milk of the sea, these tasty bivalve mollusks can be found on sea rocks all around Eorzea, but it is said the plumpest, most succulent grow in the nutrient-rich waters of the Rothlyt Sound.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Rothlyt Oyster
