#. ja: ブルーオクトパス
#. de: blau[a] Oktopus
#. fr: poulpe azur
#. column 2: blue octopodes
#. column 8: The somber blue tone of its skin does not make this variety of octopus any more docile than its crimson cousins. It is a crafty hunter who lurks in the shadows, snatching unwary prey and strangling it with its powerful eight arms before shredding it with its razor-sharp beak.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Blue Octopus
msgctxt "Item:4885:0:0"
msgid "blue octopus"
msgstr "синий осьминог"

