#. ja: アッシュトゥーナ
#. de: Aschethunfisch
#. fr: thon de la Cendre
#. column 2: ash tuna
#. column 8: A large saltwater fish known to migrate between the Sea of Jade and the Sea of Ash. In recent years, overfishing by boats from the Far East has led to a significant drop in their numbers.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Ash Tuna
msgctxt "Item:4896:0:0"
msgid "ash tuna"
msgstr "тунцовая рыба Эш"

