msgstr "Камбала"

#. ja: シーデビル
#. de: Seeteufel
#. fr: démon marin
#. column 2: sea devils
#. column 8: Legends tell of giant sea devils emerging from the sea to wrap their many arms around ships and drag them to the abyss. This seems impossible today, as the largest catches in recent memory are little more than a yalm across.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Sea Devil
msgctxt "Item:4910:0:0"
msgid "sea devil"
msgstr "морской дьявол"

#. de: Seeteufel
#. fr: démons marins
#. column 0: sea devil
#. column 8: Legends tell of giant sea devils emerging from the sea to wrap their many arms around ships and drag them to the abyss. This seems impossible today, as the largest catches in recent memory are little more than a yalm across.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Sea Devil
msgctxt "Item:4910:0:2"
msgid "sea devils"
msgstr "морские дьяволы"

#. ja: 不気味な姿で知られる頭足類<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Legenden berichten von riesigen Seeteufeln, die ihre zahlreichen Fangarme um Schiffe schlingen und diese in den Abgrund ziehen. Das scheint heutzutage unmöglich, da die größten Fänge in jüngster Zeit gerade mal einen Yalm lang waren. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poulpe hante les plus folles histoires de voyages marins et sous-marins.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: sea devil
#. column 2: sea devils
#. column 9: Sea Devil
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:4910:0:8"
msgid "Legends tell of giant sea devils emerging from the sea to wrap their many arms around ships and drag them to the abyss. This seems impossible today, as the largest catches in recent memory are little more than a yalm across.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Легенды гласят, что гигантские морские дьяволы поднимались из глубин, обвивали корабли своими многочисленными щупальцами и утаскивали их в пучину. Сейчас в это трудно поверить: самые крупные из пойманных за последнее время едва превышали ярд в ширину.<br><br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбных отпечатков большого размера.]"

#. ja: シーデビル
#. de: Seeteufel
#. fr: Démon marin
#. column 0: sea devil
#. column 2: sea devils
#. column 8: Legends tell of giant sea devils emerging from the sea to wrap their many arms around ships and drag them to the abyss. This seems impossible today, as the largest catches in recent memory are little more than a yalm across.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:4910:0:9"
msgid "Sea Devil"
msgstr "Морской дьявол"

#. ja: ロックロブスター
#. de: Steinhummer
#. fr: homard des rochers
#. column 2: rock lobsters
#. column 8: A large crimson crustacean commonly found hiding in the rocks off the shores of islands dotting the Rhotano Sea. The rich, flavorful tails are regarded as a delicacy across Eorzea.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Rock Lobster
msgctxt "Item:4911:0:0"
msgid "rock lobster"
msgstr "скальный омар"

#. de: Steinhummer
#. fr: homards des rochers
#. column 0: rock lobster
