#. de: Großmaul-Seeteufel
#. fr: baudroie
#. column 2: goosefish
#. column 8: A large-mouthed saltwater glutton, thought to feed on most anything, from smaller fish, to seaweed, to the flesh of drowned sailors.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Goosefish
msgctxt "Item:4912:0:0"
msgid "goosefish"
msgstr "гусь-рыба"

