msgstr "Гусь-рыба"

#. ja: リトルサラオス
#. de: klein[a] Thalaos
#. fr: petit Thalaos
#. column 2: little Thalaos
#. column 8: Despite the modifier, the little Thalaos is anything but small; though compared to the Thalaos of legend, even the largest of sea serpents would be deemed “little.” Normally only found far offshore in the Indigo Deep, this rare wavekin can sometimes be found swimming near the eastern cliffs of La Noscea.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Little Thalaos
msgctxt "Item:4913:0:0"
msgid "little Thalaos"
msgstr "малый Талаос"

#. de: klein[a] Thalaos
#. fr: petits Thalaos
#. column 0: little Thalaos
#. column 8: Despite the modifier, the little Thalaos is anything but small; though compared to the Thalaos of legend, even the largest of sea serpents would be deemed “little.” Normally only found far offshore in the Indigo Deep, this rare wavekin can sometimes be found swimming near the eastern cliffs of La Noscea.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Little Thalaos
msgctxt "Item:4913:0:2"
msgid "little Thalaos"
msgstr "малые Талаосы"

#. ja: 蒼茫洋の深海に棲息するとされる海水魚。稀に近海に現れる<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Trotz des Namenszusatzes ist dieser Thalaos alles andere als klein. Im Vergleich zum legendären Thalaos wären aber wohl selbst die größten Seeschlangen als klein zu bezeichnen. Der kleine Thalaos kommt überwiegend in den Indigotiefen vor, aber vereinzelt wurden auch Exemplare in der Nähe der östlichen Klippen von La Noscea gesichtet. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Malgré l'adjectif qui compose son nom, ce poisson de mer n'est en aucun cas petit. On le rencontre parfois près de la surface, dans l'océan Indigo.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: little Thalaos
#. column 2: little Thalaos
#. column 9: Little Thalaos
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:4913:0:8"
msgid "Despite the modifier, the little Thalaos is anything but small; though compared to the Thalaos of legend, even the largest of sea serpents would be deemed “little.” Normally only found far offshore in the Indigo Deep, this rare wavekin can sometimes be found swimming near the eastern cliffs of La Noscea.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Как бы ни называли эту рыбу, маленькой её не назовёшь. Но рядом с легендарным Талаосом даже крупнейший морской змей покажется крохой. Обычно её можно встретить лишь далеко от берега, в Глубинах Индиго, но иногда она подплывает к восточным утёсам Ла-Носкеи.<br><br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбных отпечатков большого размера.]"

