#. ja: マヒマヒ
#. de: Mahi-mahi
#. fr: mahi-mahi
#. column 2: mahi-mahi
#. column 8: This deep-sea predator is not only massive, but deceptively fast. Some sailors swear that a mahi-mahi can make the journey from Meracydia to the Cieldalaes in less than a fortnight, though knowing most sailors, that claim may be slightly exaggerated.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Mahi-mahi
msgctxt "Item:4915:0:0"
msgid "mahi-mahi"
msgstr "махи-махи"

#. de: Mahi-mahi
#. fr: mahi-mahi
#. column 0: mahi-mahi
#. column 8: This deep-sea predator is not only massive, but deceptively fast. Some sailors swear that a mahi-mahi can make the journey from Meracydia to the Cieldalaes in less than a fortnight, though knowing most sailors, that claim may be slightly exaggerated.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Mahi-mahi
msgctxt "Item:4915:0:2"
msgid "mahi-mahi"
msgstr "махи-махи"

#. ja: 南洋諸島由来の名で知られる大型の肉食海水魚<br>[魚拓額縁G3に設定可能]
#. de: Dieser Tiefsee-Raubfisch ist nicht nur riesig, sondern auch extrem schnell. Einige Seeleute schwören, dass ein Mahi-mahi die Strecke von Meracydia bis zu den Cieldaläen in weniger als zwei Wochen zurücklegen kann. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe L ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un poisson d'eau de mer carnivore dont le nom commun provient d'un dialecte des îles du sud.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de grande taille]
#. column 0: mahi-mahi
#. column 2: mahi-mahi
#. column 9: Mahi-mahi
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:4915:0:8"
msgid "This deep-sea predator is not only massive, but deceptively fast. Some sailors swear that a mahi-mahi can make the journey from Meracydia to the Cieldalaes in less than a fortnight, though knowing most sailors, that claim may be slightly exaggerated.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]"
msgstr "Крупный глубоководный хищник, который не только огромен, но и на удивление быстр. Моряки уверяют, что махи-махи может доплыть от Мерацидии до Сьельдалэ меньше чем за две недели. Впрочем, моряки любят приврать.<br><br>[Можно выставить в рамке для рыбных отпечатков большого размера.]"

