#. ja: エーコンスネイル
#. de: Eichelschnecke
#. fr: escargot-gland
#. column 2: acorn snails
#. column 8: Believed to have hitched a ride on the hull of a trade ship, the acorn snail is an invasive species originally from the New World, far to the west. As it has few natural predators in Eorzea, its numbers have exploded in recent years.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Acorn Snail
msgctxt "Item:4944:0:0"
msgid "acorn snail"
msgstr "желудёвая улитка"

