msgstr "Медная рыбка"

#. ja: ブルーサーモン
#. de: Blauglocken-Lachs
#. fr: saumon indigo
#. column 2: bluebell salmon
#. column 8: Hatched far up inland rivers, bluebell salmon will travel all the way downstream to the Indigo Deep where they will spend the majority of their adulthood. Then, however, when it comes time to spawn, they will return back upstream to the place of their birth.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Bluebell Salmon
msgctxt "Item:4949:0:0"
msgid "bluebell salmon"
msgstr "голубой лосось"

#. de: Blauglocken-Lachse
#. fr: saumons indigo
#. column 0: bluebell salmon
#. column 8: Hatched far up inland rivers, bluebell salmon will travel all the way downstream to the Indigo Deep where they will spend the majority of their adulthood. Then, however, when it comes time to spawn, they will return back upstream to the place of their birth.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Bluebell Salmon
msgctxt "Item:4949:0:2"
msgid "bluebell salmon"
msgstr "голубые лососи"

#. ja: 蒼茫洋で生育し、産卵期に河川を遡上する藍鉄色の淡水魚<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Der Blauglocken-Lachs schlüpft in tief im Landesinneren gelegenen Bächen und Flüssen und bahnt sich von dort den weiten Weg bis hin zu den Indigo-Tiefen. Erst wenn die Zeit zum Laichen gekommen ist, kehrt er an seine Geburtsstätte zurück. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson anadrome vit normalement dans l'océan Indigo, mais remonte le courant jusqu'à sa rivière natale pour se reproduire.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: bluebell salmon
#. column 2: bluebell salmon
#. column 9: Bluebell Salmon
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:4949:0:8"
msgid "Hatched far up inland rivers, bluebell salmon will travel all the way downstream to the Indigo Deep where they will spend the majority of their adulthood. Then, however, when it comes time to spawn, they will return back upstream to the place of their birth.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Голубой лосось появляется на свет в верховьях рек и спускается к Индиговым глубинам, где проводит большую часть жизни. Но когда приходит время нереста, он возвращается вверх по течению, к месту своего рождения.<br><br>[Можно сделать рыбный отпечаток на маленьком холсте.]"

