#. ja: カラードカープ
#. de: dreifarbig[a] Karpfen
#. fr: carpe tricolore
#. column 2: tricolored carp
#. column 8: Patches of gold, silver, and bronze cover this medium-sized freshwater fish's body, making it a favorite choice for the private garden pools of Ul'dahn nobles.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
