#. ja: コボルドパファー
#. de: Kobold-Kugelfisch
#. fr: tétrodon kobold
#. column 2: kobold puffers
#. column 8: Similar to the spotted puffer, the kobold puffer can also survive in the brackish waters of deltas and river mouths. Its spots, however, are replaced with a hideous coat of bristly spines which give it the appearance of a bedraggled kobold.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Kobold Puffer
msgctxt "Item:4998:0:0"
msgid "kobold puffer"
msgstr "кобольдская рыба-шар"

#. de: Kobold-Kugelfische
#. fr: tétrodons kobolds
#. column 0: kobold puffer
#. column 8: Similar to the spotted puffer, the kobold puffer can also survive in the brackish waters of deltas and river mouths. Its spots, however, are replaced with a hideous coat of bristly spines which give it the appearance of a bedraggled kobold.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Kobold Puffer
msgctxt "Item:4998:0:2"
msgid "kobold puffers"
msgstr "кобольдские рыбы-шары"

#. ja: 海水と淡水が混じり合う汽水域に棲息する小型の魚<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Ist ähnlich wie der gefleckte Kugelfisch in Flussmündungen überlebensfähig. Anstelle von Flecken hat er jedoch borstige Stacheln, die ihm das Aussehen eines seltsamen Kobolds verleihen. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce poisson vit en eau saumâtre dans les zones où eau salée et eau douce se rencontrent, comme les estuaires.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: kobold puffer
#. column 2: kobold puffers
#. column 9: Kobold Puffer
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:4998:0:8"
msgid "Similar to the spotted puffer, the kobold puffer can also survive in the brackish waters of deltas and river mouths. Its spots, however, are replaced with a hideous coat of bristly spines which give it the appearance of a bedraggled kobold.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Как и пятнистая рыба-шар, эта рыбка может жить в солоноватой воде дельт и устьев рек. Но вместо пятен у неё отвратительные щетинистые шипы, из-за которых она похожа на растрёпанного кобольда.<br><br>[Можно поместить в маленькую рыбную рамку.]"

#. ja: コボルドパファー
#. de: Kobold-Kugelfisch
#. fr: Tétrodon kobold
#. column 0: kobold puffer
