#. column 8: Similar to the spotted puffer, the kobold puffer can also survive in the brackish waters of deltas and river mouths. Its spots, however, are replaced with a hideous coat of bristly spines which give it the appearance of a bedraggled kobold.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:4998:0:9"
msgid "Kobold Puffer"
msgstr "Кобольдская рыба-шар"

#. ja: 射手魚
#. de: Bogenschützenfisch
#. fr: poisson-archer
#. column 2: archerfish
#. column 8: When feeding, the archerfish will lift its head ever so slightly above a lake's or river's surface and spit a stream of water up to a yalm to strike flies from low-lying branches into the water with remarkable accuracy.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Archerfish
msgctxt "Item:4999:0:0"
msgid "archerfish"
msgstr "рыба-брызгун"

#. de: Bogenschützenfische
#. fr: poissons-archers
#. column 0: archerfish
#. column 8: When feeding, the archerfish will lift its head ever so slightly above a lake's or river's surface and spit a stream of water up to a yalm to strike flies from low-lying branches into the water with remarkable accuracy.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Archerfish
msgctxt "Item:4999:0:2"
msgid "archerfish"
msgstr "рыбы-брызгуны"

#. ja: 水を吹いて虫を射落として食べる、変わった淡水魚<br>[G2以上の水槽で飼育可能]<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Zum Fressen hebt der Bogenschützenfisch seinen Kopf ganz leicht über die Was<shy>ser<shy>o<shy>ber<shy>flä<shy>che und spuckt einen Wasserstrahl mit erstaunlicher Präzision bis zu einem Yalm weit auf Fliegen, die auf niedrigen Ästen sitzen. (Kann in Aquarien der Größe M oder größer gehalten werden. Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Ce curieux poisson d'eau douce peut envoyer un jet d'eau dans les airs pour capturer ses proies.<br>[Peut être élevé dans un aquarium de taille moyenne ou supérieure]<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: archerfish
#. column 2: archerfish
#. column 9: Archerfish
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:4999:0:8"
msgid "When feeding, the archerfish will lift its head ever so slightly above a lake's or river's surface and spit a stream of water up to a yalm to strike flies from low-lying branches into the water with remarkable accuracy.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Во время охоты рыба-брызгун чуть приподнимает голову над поверхностью озера или реки и с удивительной меткостью сбивает мух с низких веток струёй воды, бьющей на целый ялм.<br><br>[Можно поселить в аквариуме II уровня или выше.]<br>[Можно поместить в среднюю рыбную рамку.]"

